>> title: Sweet & Spicy Chicken Thighs
>> servings: 4
>> source: https://www.budgetbytes.com/sweet-and-spicy-glazed-chicken-thighs/

Combine @brown sugar{0.25%cup}, @cayenne pepper{0.5%tsp}, @garlic powder{0.5%tsp}, @paprika{0.5%tsp}, @salt{0.5%tsp}, and @black pepper{0.5%tsp} in a #small bowl{}.

Pat dry @chicken thighs{1.5%lbs} and place in a #medium bowl{}. Sprinkle the brown sugar mixture over the chicken and coat each side liberally.

Heat a #skillet{} over medium. Once hot, add @olive oil{1%tbsp} and swirl to coat. Add the coated chicken and cook for about ~{5-7%minutes} on each side, or until cooked through and the brown sugar has turned into a deep brown glaze. Serve hot.